<task id="005" project="spaarkeai-compose-r4">
  <metadata>
    <title>Applier spike on the CIPO doc + Patch-engine A/B (Docxodus vs OpenXML-SDK) (FR-04/FR-11 choice)</title>
    <phase>0 Gate</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>The hardest R4 surface (offset→run split + w:ins/w:del at an interior paraId+offset) proven before the Phase-3 commit; decides the FR-04/FR-11 implementation engine and evaluates a candidate new dependency. High blast radius.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>The hardest surface (offset→run split + native w:ins/w:del on a real worst-offender doc) must be proven before commit; the A/B recommendation decides the FR-04 implementation. Deep OOXML judgment.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>W0b</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Throwaway spike code in an isolated spike location; no overlap with task 004 (harness). Both run in wave W0b.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>002,003</deps>
    <tags>bff-api,docx,spike</tags>
    <estimated-effort>3-4 days</estimated-effort>
