    <patterns>
      <pattern name="Canonical split-run recipe" location="projects/spaarkeai-compose-r4/notes/bridge-prior-art.md finding #6">
        Match w:p by w14:paraId → walk runs accumulating text length until offset lands in run R → Run.Clone()-split R preserving RunProperties → wrap inserts in InsertedRun(w:ins) / deletes in DeletedRun(w:del) with Author/Date/Id. Mutate the DOM, never string-edit document.xml.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Para-mark deletion (merge) edge" location="projects/spaarkeai-compose-r4/notes/bridge-prior-art.md finding #6">
        Paragraph-mark deletion = w:del on the para-mark glyph in w:pPr/w:rPr — flagged as the hardest edge; probe it in the spike so task 031 has evidence.
      </pattern>
